--- body ---
## Context

Exp2 began as an "extension of Exp2 to arms 3 and 4", then was reframed **from the
start** as a 2×2 design — the second abandoned branch (companion to 0361's modular
ablation). The **slides already carry the live 2×2**, framed as observable
commercial-AI-product features: (single-turn vs multi-turn) × (no-docs vs RAG),
conditions 1N/5N/1D/5D (slides.tex:279-292), with `tab_exp2_2x2` at slides.tex:349
generated by `tabulate_exp2_2x2.py`, and the finding "Effet du RAG > effet du
multitour" (slides.tex:344).

The **report never finished the migration**: it still
`\InputIfFileExists{tab_exp2_arms}` (report.tex:200) and carries four "arms"
generators. This is a **reconciliation, not a deletion** — Exp2 is a live
experiment; only its old "arms" framing is stale.

## Scope

**Report (adopt the 2×2 features framing):**
- Replace `tab_exp2_arms` (report.tex:200) with the 2×2 presentation (`tab_exp2_2x2`
  or a report-tuned variant from `tabulate_exp2_2x2.py`).
- Align Exp2 prose with the 1N/5N/1D/5D conditions and the "RAG > multitour"
  finding: the "bras naive/optimisé" caption (report.tex:206) and "bras corrigé"
  (report.tex:404) language.
- Decide `fig_quality_spider` (`fig:exp2-quality-spider`, report.tex:202-208,
  `\IfFileExists`, "bras naive et optimise"): re-label to 2×2 or retire.

**Retire the 'arms' artifacts:**
- `report/inputs/generated/tab_exp2_arms.tex`,
  `src/aedist/{plot_exp2_arms_comparison.py, plot_exp2_arms_split.py,
  tabulate_exp2_arms.py, tabulate_exp2_arms_runs.py}` + their tests.
- Makefile: the `tab_exp2_arms` rule + tokens (report.pdf prereqs ~223, `tables:` ~256).
- **KEEP** `tabulate_exp2_2x2.py` and `tab_exp2_2x2` (the live design).

## Test (first)
`tests/test_exp2_arms_retired.py` (`@pytest.mark.adherence`):
- no `tab_exp2_arms` / `exp2_arms`-generator refs in `report/*.tex`, `Makefile`,
  `src/aedist/`;
- report Exp2 presents the 2×2 (grep for `tab_exp2_2x2` or the 1N/5N/1D/5D
  conditions);
- `make report` and `make slides` build.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] report Exp2 presents the 2×2 features design; `tab_exp2_arms` no longer used
- [ ] arms generators/tables/tests removed; Makefile carries no `exp2_arms` token; `tabulate_exp2_2x2` kept
- [ ] `fig_quality_spider` re-labeled to 2×2 or retired
- [ ] `make report` and `make slides` build; `make check` passes; test green
